{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/838843-aberrant-question-severity-of-reality-tv","id":838843,"title":"Aberrant question: Severity of Reality TV","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-28T16:15:33-08:00","id":838843,"title":"Aberrant question: Severity of Reality TV","content":"For the past few years, I just plain haven't watched much television, if at all, so I'm out of the loop when it comes to stuff like &quot;Reality Entertainment.&quot; Recollection suggests that it was a big deal back in the 2000's, which partially explains why I stick to the internet.<br /> <br /> So folks, just how bad is Reality TV and media nowadays (both in quality and ubiquity)? Just how much of the world will Nova culture take over when Joe Q Public gets people who are both interesting <i>and</i> important to obsess over?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T11:44:04-08:00","id":839333,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/838843-aberrant-question-severity-of-reality-tv#post838843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For the past few years, I just plain haven't watched much television, if at all, so I'm out of the loop when it comes to stuff like &quot;Reality Entertainment.&quot; Recollection suggests that it was a big deal back in the 2000's, which partially explains why I stick to the internet.<br /> <br /> So folks, just how bad is Reality TV and media nowadays (both in quality and ubiquity)? Just how much of the world will Nova culture take over when Joe Q Public gets people who are both interesting <i>and</i> important to obsess over?</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, i don't see Reality TV having that much of a space with Nova and a channel dedicated to them and crazy stuff they can do like N! around. Simply put, super-powers have a far greater entertainment potential than pathetic pseudo-drama of a bunch of nobodies in a confined enviroment or another. That said, i could imagine N!, XWF and other media trying to develop a whole bunch of programs focused on &quot;power competitions&quot; and such - one of my first Aberrant groups had a Directive agent that moved across the world under the hilariously visible (and convenient) cover of being the frontman of X-Survivor, an extremes Nova sports program with stuff like parachuteless diving, lava-swimming and other outrageously suicidal stuff. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T13:06:33-08:00","id":839381,"title":"","content":"Reality TV is dying(not fast enough), and Superhero/comicbook shows are on the rise. Make of that what you will.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div> &quot;A free society is one in which it is safe to be unpopular.&quot;<br /> <span style=\"color:DarkRed\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS\">I find <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=3&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwin4NXQzLfXAhVGySYKHV3TDXYQFgg3MAI&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ign.com%2Farticles%2F2017%2F04%2F25%2Fmarvels-nick-spencer-on-captain-americas-betrayal-and-handling-fan-reactions&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EcsX7n5ebntygb0TizyGl\" target=\"_blank\">Nick Spencer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiK7d7szLfXAhXCWSYKHTpKBbcQFgg4MAM&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRichard_B._Spencer&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuP6phfINia-bh_jWsDT_\" target=\"_blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T14:37:28-08:00","id":839440,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mangle77</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/838843-aberrant-question-severity-of-reality-tv?p=839381#post839381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Reality TV is dying(not fast enough), and Superhero/comicbook shows are on the rise. Make of that what you will.</div> </div> </div> </div>OH THANK GO- I mean, uh, thank you. Very helpful.<br /> <br /> So, it seems pretty certain that actual superheroics will take over the space that reality tv once occupied - good. Now I wonder what kinds of dirty tricks the media will try to squeeze every ounce of drama they can out of these terribly interesting superhumans...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T20:49:30-08:00","id":839656,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mangle77</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/838843-aberrant-question-severity-of-reality-tv?p=839381#post839381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Reality TV is dying(not fast enough), and Superhero/comicbook shows are on the rise. Make of that what you will.</div> </div> </div> </div>Once the Nova Age begins these become the same thing. Tune in to watch 2Morrow battle terrorists and rogue Nova threats, stay for their personal drama and talking head confessions!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T21:55:28-08:00","id":839687,"title":"","content":"I guess the question would be &quot;how much of N! is scripted?&quot;. How much are Novas paid to do it and how cushy is the job? How far will N! go to protect these stars from their own drama? Dramatic and antagonistic archetypes are generally the most popular or successful reality stars - those traits in super-powered folk traditionally occur in villains more than heroes.<br /> -shrug-<br /> Not really a fan of reality tv, but the sociology of it can be interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4458-nihilist","name":"Nihilist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4458_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"259"}]},"thanke